DESCRIPTION:Fresh off winning their 15th Grey Cup Championship\, the Edmon
 ton Elks are bringing the party to Edmonton EXPO Centre on Tuesday\, Novem
 ber 17. Fans are invited to join the 2026 Grey Cup Champion Elks at Edmont
 on EXPO Centre Arena at 6:30 p.m.\, where the team will celebrate their 37
 -30 victory over the Montreal Alouettes on Sunday. Admission to the celebr
 ation is free\, and fans are encouraged to bring their Green and Gold prid
 e and come join in the championship festivities. Doors to the Edmonton EXP
 O Arena open at 5:30 p.m. and public parking is available around the facil
 ity. For more details on how to get to the Edmonton EXPO Centre\, click HE
 RE. Fans will hear from Elks Head Coach Mark Kilam\, 2026 Grey Cup Most Ou
 tstanding Player Cody Fajardo\, and more throughout the evening. Header ph
 oto taken by Dale MacMillan with the Edmonton Elks.\n\nFresh off winning t
 heir 15th Grey Cup Championship\, the Edmonton Elks are bringing the party
  to Edmonton EXPO Centre on Tuesday\, November 17 .\n\nFans are invited to
  join the 2026 Grey Cup Champion Elks at Edmonton EXPO Centre Arena at 6:3
 0 p.m. \, where the team will celebrate their 37-30 victory over the Montr
 eal Alouettes on Sunday.\n\nAdmission to the celebration is free\, and fan
 s are encouraged to bring their Green and Gold pride and come join in the 
 championship festivities. Doors to the Edmonton EXPO Arena open at 5:30 p.
 m. and public parking is available around the facility. For more details o
 n how to get to the Edmonton EXPO Centre\, click HERE .\n\nFans will hear 
 from Elks Head Coach Mark Kilam\, 2026 Grey Cup Most Outstanding Player Co
 dy Fajardo\, and more throughout the evening.\n\nHeader photo taken by Dal
 e MacMillan with the Edmonton Elks.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Tuesda
 y\, November 17\, 2026 at 5:30 PM\nLocation: Edmonton EXPO Centre\, Edmont
 on\, AB\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar
